mark draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): a duplicate of code/mutex.tree. It declared tasks that bound nothing, so a call built clean and
# threw `stub` at run time; out of the build until it has bodies.


form lock
  link dock, mark private

form guard
  link dock, mark private

task make
  like lock

task acquire
  mark async
  take lock, like lock
  like guard

task release
  take guard, like guard
